.TH ENGINE_TOGGLE_FULLSCREEN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
engine_toggle_fullscreen \- Switch between windowed and borderless fullscreen
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.BI "void engine_toggle_fullscreen(Engine *e);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Switch between windowed and borderless fullscreen. Logical size is unchanged; the frame is letterboxed. Bound to F11 by the engine, so an options menu item usually just calls this.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_init (3),
.BR EngineConfig (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
